                                        "entry_id": "29257d87-7f31-3175-9d95-6dd5fe0c0427",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A long, low table, often placed in front of a sofa or seating area in a living room."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bdf2741-2b4d-48a2-a903-32e37f3942b2",
                                                "sense_id": "590917ce-cfee-3f46-871a-3a5a9fde1798",
                                                "text": "We were just settling ourselves around the coffee-table, when several friends from the parsonage arrived."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0494c843-ea4d-3c18-9e61-9e508771f54c",
                                        "entry_id": "29257d87-7f31-3175-9d95-6dd5fe0c0427",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A table from which coffee is served."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "afab55c8-10b1-4df6-923b-eadab19928a2",
                        "source_entry_id": "746a2e11-2e72-3581-9e7b-2829e88fd509",
                        "source_sense_id": "bb65187a-a93a-3b75-962a-970af554a395",
                        "source_sense_description": "relativ niedriger Tisch, der an/vor einer Couch oder einem Sofa platziert wird",
                        "target_lang_word": "end table",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "end table",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2202a9ea-2e34-3f1d-b20b-e1a924a70120",
                                        "entry_id": "c9dad968-96d4-3507-b781-eb98760c7660",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small table placed beside a chair or at each end of a sofa."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b73d883-8c52-428b-bb2c-a2893311c947",
                                                "sense_id": "2202a9ea-2e34-3f1d-b20b-e1a924a70120",
                                                "text": "The tiny rooms are fitted with a burgundy leather chair, an end table stacked with phone books, and an ugly orange payphone common here in Australia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "59157498-8d8b-4be2-b763-2898be9c3e6e",
                        "source_entry_id": "746a2e11-2e72-3581-9e7b-2829e88fd509",
                        "source_sense_id": "bb65187a-a93a-3b75-962a-970af554a395",
                        "source_sense_description": "relativ niedriger Tisch, der an/vor einer Couch oder einem Sofa platziert wird",
                        "target_lang_word": "side table",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "side table",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17edbc79-0b7e-3c33-851d-24f9563ae455",
                                        "entry_id": "a3ddd346-e8c0-3e22-9193-9147630c0433",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small table intended to be placed beside a larger piece of furniture, such as a bed or sofa."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf82df7b-df47-4bbd-b32f-6e55f2e0c09b",
                                                "sense_id": "17edbc79-0b7e-3c33-851d-24f9563ae455",
                                                "text": "Upon the infinitely wise countrywoman’s suggestion, she goose-penned, from the edge of her bed, on a side table with cabriole legs, a love letter and took five minutes to reread it in a languorous but loud voice […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7548047f-a610-4be9-ad24-6965d8cc8717",
                                                "sense_id": "17edbc79-0b7e-3c33-851d-24f9563ae455",
                                                "text": "For his own soiree, Kane went for somewhat more conventional decorations: on a side table, Apothia candles glimmered like fireflies, guarding a taxidermied owl, while masses of delphiniums, hydrangeas, lilacs and old Dutch roses perfumed the air."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3adec537-a839-4746-9932-56c133c6b58a",
                                                "sense_id": "17edbc79-0b7e-3c33-851d-24f9563ae455",
                                                "text": "Lachlan rose to fetch a coffee pot from the side table and idly Holly wondered how those legs coped with the unroominess of canoes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1808b5b1-5253-4e77-a55f-33f49d06b733",
                        "source_entry_id": "746a2e11-2e72-3581-9e7b-2829e88fd509",
                        "source_sense_id": "bb65187a-a93a-3b75-962a-970af554a395",
                        "source_sense_description": "relativ niedriger Tisch, der an/vor einer Couch oder einem Sofa platziert wird",
                        "target_lang_word": "occasional table",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "occasional table",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "350bdca6-39e1-39cb-861d-9e511a716913",
                                        "entry_id": "c096c612-8fde-301e-810e-9b239423fb5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any small table, such as an end table, which has no particular function and may typically be folded away."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43251eda-920d-4c20-a7a7-00cbdc4c975f",
                                                "sense_id": "350bdca6-39e1-39cb-861d-9e511a716913",
                                                "text": "A cushion-covered divan; three-piece lounge-suite; occasional table, writing table and radio constituted the principal pieces[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07917568-b85c-4876-848c-86ab04e6004f",
                        "source_entry_id": "746a2e11-2e72-3581-9e7b-2829e88fd509",
                        "source_sense_id": "bb65187a-a93a-3b75-962a-970af554a395",
                        "source_sense_description": "relativ niedriger Tisch, der an/vor einer Couch oder einem Sofa platziert wird",
                        "target_lang_word": "table basse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "table basse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81ed9719-f338-3845-87e4-d8362b77e414",
                                        "entry_id": "bbd48442-c108-379c-b2a6-32c3913ab0b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Table au plateau plus bas que celui d’une table habituelle, destinée à recevoir par exemple verres et petites assiettes lors d’apéritifs, souvent placée devant un canapé ou des fauteuils."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa4416ca-643d-4759-9f7a-69ead3db0fcd",
                                                "sense_id": "81ed9719-f338-3845-87e4-d8362b77e414",
                                                "text": "Je me retrouvai enfin dans un bureau un peu mieux aménagé, où il y avait quand même un ventilateur, des rocking-chairs en rotin et, sur une table basse, quelques fioles carrées de whisky et de brandy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be750b49-b09c-453c-be7d-202c0fe9674d",
                                                "sense_id": "81ed9719-f338-3845-87e4-d8362b77e414",
                                                "text": "Tu veux essayer ? dit Harry Mitchell, en abattant son verre XXL de martini sur une table basse dotée d'une belle résonance et en s'efforçant de prendre un air de bouledogue – très convaincant, je l'admets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
